  ],
  "difficulty": 2.0,
  "summary": "赛时直接暴力打表猜出来每个灯的贡献公式。本题初衷明显是期望线性性，推贡献法的公式。",
  "link": "https://acm.hdu.edu.cn/contest/problems?cid=1229",
  "link_text": "006 开关灯",
  "source": "<a href=\"/c/2026杭电暑期多校赛1\" class=\"wikilink\">2026杭电暑期多校赛1</a>",
  "aliases": [],
  "parent": null,
  "format": "logseq",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "题目描述",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "一排 $n$ 盏灯，编号 $1, 2, \\dots, n$，第 $i$ 盏灯权值为 $a_i$，初始全部关闭。",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "随机选择一个 $1 \\sim n$ 的排列，按排列顺序依次打开所有灯。",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "每打开一盏灯后，亮着的灯形成若干个<strong>极大连续段</strong>；若当前共有 $c$ 段，且这次打开的是第 $i$ 盏灯，则获得 $a_i \\cdot c$ 分。",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "求最终总得分的期望，答案对 $998244353$ 取模。",
          "depth": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入描述",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "第一行 $T$（$1 \\le T \\le 2 \\times 10^5$）。",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "每组数据两行：$n$（$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\times 10^5$），第二行 $n$ 个整数 $a_i$（$0 \\le a_i < 998244353$）。",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "保证单个测试点内所有测试数据的 $n$ 之和 $\\le 2 \\times 10^5$。",
          "depth": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出描述",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "每行输出期望值模 $998244353$ 的结果：答案是最简分数 $\\frac{x}{y}$，输出 $x \\cdot y^{-1} \\bmod 998244353$。",
          "depth": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": "输入",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "",
              "code": "2\n1\n10\n3\n1 2 3",
              "depth": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "输出",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "",
              "code": "10\n665496242",
              "depth": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "样例说明",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "第一组 $n=1,\\ a=(10)$：只有一盏灯，点亮即 $1$ 段，得分 $10$。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "第二组 $n=3,\\ a=(1,2,3)$：枚举 $6$ 种开灯顺序，得分分别为 $6,9,6,6,7,6$，期望 $\\frac{40}{6}=\\frac{20}{3}\\equiv 665496242 \\pmod{998244353}$。",
              "depth": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "题解",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<img src=\"/images/IMG20260829005136_1787938864071_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG20260829005136.jpg\" class=\"note-img\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />",
          "depth": 1
        },
        {
          "heading": "核心思路",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "总得分期望拆成对每盏灯求和：$E[\\text{总分}] = \\sum_i a_i \\cdot E[c_i]$，其中 $c_i$ 为第 $i$ 盏灯点亮后的连续段数（$a_i$ 是常数，期望线性性直接拆和）。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "<strong>可以发现</strong>：亮灯集合 $S$ 的极大连续段数 $c = |S| - e(S)$，其中 $e(S)$ 是<strong>相邻亮灯对</strong> $(j,j+1)$ 的个数。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "于是 $E[c_i] = E[|S_i|] - E[e(S_i)]$。",
              "depth": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "E[|S_i|]：亮灯数的期望",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "第 $i$ 盏灯被点亮的时刻 $\\mathrm{pos}(i)$ 在 $\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$ 上均匀分布（排列随机、灯与灯对称），且该时刻亮灯数恰为 $\\mathrm{pos}(i)$。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "$E[|S_i|] = E[\\mathrm{pos}(i)] = \\frac{n+1}{2}$。",
              "depth": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "E[e(S_i)]：逐对指示变量",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "$e(S_i) = \\sum_{(j,j+1)} I\\{\\text{第 } j,j+1 \\text{ 盏灯在 } i \\text{ 亮时均已亮}\\}$，由线性性 $E[e] = \\sum P(\\cdots)$（各对之间强相关，线性性保证只需要边际概率）。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "固定相邻对 $(x,y)$ 与灯 $i$：三盏灯在随机排列中的相对顺序 $3! = 6$ 种等可能。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "<strong>一般对</strong>（$x,y \\ne i$）：$I=1 \\iff x,y$ 都在 $i$ 之前 $\\to$ $6$ 种中 $2$ 种，$P = \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{1}{3}$。",
              "depth": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "<strong>特殊对</strong> $(i-1,i)$、$(i,i+1)$：$i$ 自己此时已亮，只要求另一端在 $i$ 之前 $\\to$ $P = \\frac{1}{2}$。",
              "depth": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "令 $s_i = [i>1] + [i<n]$（含 $i$ 的相邻对数），其余 $n-1-s_i$ 对为一般对：",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "$E[e(S_i)] = \\frac{n-1-s_i}{3} + \\frac{s_i}{2} = \\frac{n-1}{3} + \\frac{s_i}{6}$。",
              "depth": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "结论",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "$E[c_i] = \\frac{n+1}{2} - \\frac{n-1}{3} - \\frac{s_i}{6} = \\frac{n+5-s_i}{6}$。",
              "depth": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "$Ans = \\sum_i a_i \\cdot \\frac{n+5-s_i}{6}$，展开化简得 $Ans = \\frac{(n+3) \\cdot \\sum a_i + a_1 + a_n}{6}$（$n=1$ 也成立）。",
              "depth": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "代码",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "cpp",
          "code": "constexpr ll INV2 = Math::inv(2, mod), INV3 = Math::inv(3, mod);\nvoid solve(int CASE)\n{\n\tint n; cin >> n;\n\tvar a = vector<ll>(n + 1);\n\tfa(i, 1, n)cin >> a[i];\n\tif (n == 1) {\n\t\tcout << a[1] << endl;\n\t\treturn;\n\t}\n\tll e1 = (n + 1ll) * INV2 % mod;\n\tll ans = 0;\n\tfa(i, 1, n) {\n\t\tll e2 = 0;\n\t\tif (i == 1 or i == n)e2 = (e2 + (INV2 + (n - 2ll) * INV3 % mod) % mod) % mod;\n\t\telse e2 = (e2 + (1 + (n - 3ll) * INV3 % mod) % mod) % mod;\n\t\tans = (ans + ((e1 - e2) % mod + mod) % mod * a[i] % mod) % mod;\n\t}\n\tcout << ans << endl;\n\treturn;\n}",
          "depth": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
